---
import { project } from "../data/project";
import ActionLink from "./ActionLink.astro";
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---

<Section id="lokasi" ruled>
  <SectionHeading id="lokasi-title" title="Lokasi di Padalarang" />
  <div class="location-layout">
    <div class="address-block">
      <p class="location-label">{project.name}</p>
      <address>{project.address}</address>
      <ActionLink href={project.mapUrl} variant="secondary" icon="map-pin" external>Buka di Google Maps</ActionLink>
    </div>
    <div class="location-context">
      <p>Informasi proyek menyebut kedekatan dengan Kota Baru Parahyangan, akses tol Padalarang, area perbelanjaan, pendidikan, dan layanan kesehatan.</p>
      <p class="location-note">Gunakan tautan Google Maps untuk melihat titik lokasi dan menilai rute sesuai kebutuhan Anda.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .location-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-12); }
  .location-label { margin-block-end: var(--space-3); font-weight: var(--weight-heading); }
  address { max-inline-size: 40ch; margin-block-end: var(--space-6); font-style: normal; font-size: var(--text-lead); line-height: var(--leading-lead); }
  .location-context { border-block-start: var(--border-width) solid var(--line); padding-block-start: var(--space-5); }
  .location-context p { color: var(--muted); }
  .location-note { margin-block-start: var(--space-4); font-size: var(--text-small); }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .location-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-8); } }
</style>
